'TITLE OF THE PROBLEM: Gypsum in equilibrium'
'----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------'
'COMPUTATION OPTIONS'
1			! Option to compute Jacobians (0: incremental coefficients, 1: analyticially)
.true.			! Lumping flag
4			! Estimation of downstream waters reaction rates (4 options, see documentation for details)
2			! Averaging kinetic reaction rates option (1: concentrations, 2: reaction rates)
.false.			! Mixing flag (.true.: mix per reactive zone, .false.: mix directly over all waters)
'----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------'
'end'